System Goal
For individuals and organizations managing recurring expenses, reduce average monthly overspending across food, clothing, events, and similar categories by 25%, measured by the difference between planned and actual spending, moving from a baseline established during the user’s first month to the target within 90 days, without making purchases or financial transfers, overriding user priorities, or presenting estimates as guaranteed outcomes.

Who Is Better Off When This Works?
Organizations or individuals who are in need of assistance in budgeting the money that they spend on various things, especially those who have trouble analyzing the gap between their past spending and the money that they have available, can benefit from this agent.
